      "story_id": 1,
      "headline": "Sheinbaum attends Barcelona Democracy Summit, mends ties with Spain, and champions Cuba solidarity",
      "summary": "President Sheinbaum made her first trip to Europe as president (April 17\u201319), attending the IV Summit in Defense of Democracy in Barcelona hosted by Spain's S\u00e1nchez. The visit ended an eight-year diplomatic freeze rooted in AMLO's 2019 colonial-apology demand; Sheinbaum declared there was 'never a crisis' with Spain. At the summit she met Lula, Petro, and other progressive leaders, proposed redirecting 10% of global military spending to reforestation, co-signed a joint statement with Brazil and Spain pledging increased aid to Cuba and opposing military intervention, and separately visited the Barcelona Supercomputing Center to announce collaboration on Mexico's 'Coatlicue' supercomputer project before flying home commercial economy class.",
